# BUILD A PREMIUM COMPLETE EDUCATION PLATFORM — INFOCUS ACADEMY

Design a complete, premium, modern, professional, responsive educational website and online learning platform for INFOCUS ACADEMY, located in Kalkaji, New Delhi, India.

This is NOT just a coaching institute website.

This is a complete education platform combining:

1. Premium Course-Selling Website
2. Online Course Marketplace
3. Student Registration and Login
4. Student Dashboard
5. Online Learning Classroom
6. Video Lectures
7. Study Materials and Notes
8. MCQ Practice
9. Online Tests and Mock Tests
10. Student Progress Tracking
11. Course Enrollment
12. Payment and Checkout Experience
13. Teacher Dashboard
14. Admin Dashboard
15. Course and Student Management

The platform should allow students to discover courses, understand their learning options, enrol in courses, access educational content, practice questions, take tests, track their progress, and continue their preparation directly inside the INFOCUS ACADEMY website.

The design should feel like a premium EdTech startup combined with a trusted academic coaching institute.

The platform must be visually exceptional, highly organized, easy to use, mobile-friendly, and designed for real students.

